reagent-name-aquaavari = aqua avari
reagent-desc-aquaavari = A brand of holy water cursed by both god and the malevolent hand of a crook.

reagent-name-ethanotoxin = ethanotoxin
reagent-desc-ethanotoxin = A medicinal venom from the jaw of an Allulalo. Contains a blood-clotting agent and adreno-stimulants, but your heart wont like it.

reagent-name-methanol = methanol
reagent-desc-methanol = A simple alcohol, often used as an additive to fuel alcohol to discourage consumption. Also known as wood alcohol.
